## ------------------------------------------------------------------------
@node "Help on help"
@{U}Using this help@{u}

  Click an underlined or highlighted word to follow it. In ST-Guide,
  Undo or Backspace goes back, Help shows ST-Guide's own help, and the
  Index lists every page.

  Back to the @{"Contents" link "Main"}.
@endnode
